  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nIt'd be nice if there was a setting that allowed for moderation/approval of registration. Simply having either a \"no registrations\" or \"open registrations\" policy seems a bit binary. If enabled, a queue of users that have registered, and verified their e-mail, could be placed in some sort of holding queue until approved/denied by an administrator.\r\n\r\n(And I'm assuming users that have not verified their e-mail address within nn time are already being automatically purged, otherwise, that'd be nice too.)\r\n",
